  "description": "A mother's love never fades. Ever.\n\nAfter 6 years of living alone, a trip abroad leaves Ha-Young penniless, and she's forced to move back in with her mother. After their long time apart, the two begin to get re-acquainted. But as some not-so-minor issues start to crop up, Ha-Young begins to remember why she left.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
